  "goodToKnow": "Das Evangelium is the gospel: die vier Evangelien (Matthäus, Markus, Lukas, Johannes). Figuratively, etwas für das Evangelium halten means to take it as gospel. Note: evangelisch in Germany simply means Protestant (die Evangelische Kirche in Deutschland, EKD), not evangelical in the American sense, which is evangelikal. Luther's Bible translation began with the New Testament in 1522. Plural: die Evangelien."
